		text_vn = "#C0x5B545B#Você não pode resgatar porque não participou do Red Pack Rain. Não perca da próxima vez!",
		text_id = "#C0x5B545B#Anda tidak dapat menukarkannya karena Anda tidak berpartisipasi dalam Red Pack Rain. Jangan lewatkan waktu berikutnya!",
		text_kr = "#C0x5B545B#레드팩레인에 참여하지 않으셨기 때문에 교환하실 수 없습니다. 다음 번에도 놓치지 마세요!",
		text_th = "#C0x5B545B#คุณไม่สามารถแลกได้เนื่องจากคุณไม่ได้เข้าร่วม Red Pack Rain อย่าพลาดครั้งต่อไป!",
