		text_id = "#C0x5B545B#[Dream Bud] \n Setelah Dream Bud muncul, anda bisa mengaktifkan Dream Seal\" in the interface, and after clicking, it will instantly move to the pedal where the Dream Bud is located.\"",
		text_kr = "#C0x5B545B#[Dream Bud] \n 드림버드가 나타난 후 드림씰을 활성화할 수 있습니다\" in the interface, and after clicking, it will instantly move to the pedal where the Dream Bud is located.\"",
